# Ordin host: crews, conversations, workflow files and voice
error-block-refused = ordin couldn't show that item, so it was left out. Try again.
error-chrt-external-not-member = Only members of the crew can be allowed to act outside ordin. Choose a member.
error-chrt-guardrail-above-max = One of the limits is higher than your company allows. Lower it.
error-chrt-handoff-invalid = A hand-over must be between two members of the crew. Choose crew members.
error-chrt-member-unknown = A crew needs 1 to 20 members, and each one must be an agent ordin knows. Check the list.
error-chrt-name-invalid = The crew needs a name of 1 to 80 characters. Change the name.
error-chrt-not-started-by-person = This crew can't start until its set-up has been checked. Check it, then press Start.
error-chrt-purpose-invalid = The purpose must be 1 to 2000 characters. Change the purpose.
error-chrt-role-invalid = Each member's role must be 1 to 200 characters. Change the role.
error-oh-agent-missing = An agent is missing, so this couldn't be saved. Choose an agent and save again.
error-oh-agent-unknown = ordin doesn't know that agent. Choose another one.
error-oh-attachments-invalid = A message can carry up to 20 attachments. Remove some.
error-oh-block-answered = That question has already been answered.
error-oh-block-unknown = That question isn't in this workspace any more.
error-oh-charter-unknown = That crew set-up isn't in this workspace. Choose another one.
error-oh-check-failed = The check found problems, so this wasn't saved. Fix them and save again.
error-oh-command-unknown = That agent has no command by that name. Give it the work in your own words instead.
error-oh-conversation-not-continuable = Only the latest conversation can be continued, and only once.
error-oh-conversation-unknown = That conversation can't be found.
error-oh-coordinator-no-move = ordin didn't act after a reminder, so it was stopped. Try again.
error-oh-coordinator-session-lost = ordin lost track of its work part-way through. Try again.
error-oh-coordinator-timeout = ordin took more than 10 minutes to answer, so it was stopped. Try again.
error-oh-crew-running = A crew is still working. Wait for it to finish, then try again.
error-oh-crew-run-unknown = That crew's earlier work can't be found, so it can't be run again.
error-oh-crew-too-many-members = A crew can have up to 8 members. Remove some.
error-oh-dashboard-unknown = That dashboard can't be found.
error-oh-datastore-unavailable = ordin can't reach its saved information right now. Try again in a moment.
error-oh-decision-kind-mismatch = That choice doesn't fit the question that was asked. Try again.
error-oh-dependency-failed = An agent wasn't ready to start work. Try again in a moment.
error-oh-draft-running = A draft is already being written on this computer. Wait for it to finish.
error-oh-folder-not-linked = That folder isn't linked to this workspace. Link it first.
error-oh-input-invalid = That file name or answer isn't allowed. Use a shorter name with no slashes, or an answer that fits the question.
error-oh-input-missing = A required answer is missing, so this couldn't start. Fill it in and start again.
error-oh-input-unreadable = ordin couldn't read the file you chose. Choose another file.
error-oh-message-invalid = A message must be 1 to 8,000 characters. Change the message.
error-oh-name-suffixed = That name was already in use, so a number was added to it.
error-oh-needs-agents = This workflow needs agents, so it can't start straight away. Add the agents first.
error-oh-nothing-to-draft = Every message in that language already exists, so there's nothing to draft.
error-oh-not-coordinating = No crew is waiting for that. Nothing was changed.
error-oh-not-ordin-session = That action can only be taken from ordin's own conversation, so it was stopped.
error-oh-not-persons-words = That setting can only be changed when you ask for it yourself. Ask again in your own message.
error-oh-path-unknown = That route isn't one of the choices offered. Choose one of the choices.
error-oh-remote-agent-in-workflow = A remote agent can't be used in a workflow draft. Choose an agent installed here.
error-oh-remove-not-confirmed = Nothing was removed, because it wasn't confirmed. Confirm to remove it.
error-oh-repository-unreachable = ordin couldn't read that folder. Check that it still exists.
error-oh-restore-same = That is already the latest version, so nothing was restored.
error-oh-run-not-interrupted = Only work that was interrupted or couldn't finish can be tried again.
error-oh-run-not-repeatable = This work can't be started again from here. Ask ordin in the conversation instead.
error-oh-run-unknown = That work isn't in this workspace any more.
error-oh-session-start-failed = ordin couldn't start its work. Try again.
error-oh-stale-version = Someone saved a newer version first. Open the latest one and make your change again.
error-oh-summary-failed = ordin couldn't write the summary. Try again.
error-oh-template-unknown = ordin doesn't know that starting template. Choose another one.
error-oh-too-many-waiting = Too many messages are waiting. Wait for some to be dealt with first.
error-oh-version-unknown = That version can't be found.
error-oh-workflow-unknown = That workflow can't be found.
error-oh-workspace-unknown = That workspace can't be found.
error-voice-fixed-by-company = Your company has set this part of ordin's voice, so it can't be changed.
error-voice-name-too-long = That name is too long. Use 60 characters or fewer.
error-voice-notes-too-long = Those voice notes are too long. Use 300 characters or fewer.
error-wff-agents-invalid = A workflow needs 1 to 8 agents. Add or remove some.
error-wff-agent-id-invalid = An agent's name in this file isn't valid. Copy the agent's name exactly as ordin shows it.
error-wff-agent-key-invalid = An agent's short name must start with a letter, use only lower-case letters, digits, hyphens or underscores, and be unique.
error-wff-agent-key-unknown = A step that may act outside ordin names an agent the workflow doesn't have. Choose an agent from the workflow.
error-wff-agent-name-invalid = An agent's name must be 1 to 120 characters. Change the name.
error-wff-agent-role-invalid = An agent's role must be one line of 1 to 200 characters. Change the role.
error-wff-agent-unmatched = That file names an agent you don't have. Add the agent first.
error-wff-agent-version-invalid = An agent's version isn't written in a form ordin understands. Correct the version.
error-wff-call-cycle = This would run a workflow again inside itself. Choose a different workflow.
error-wff-call-too-deep = Workflows can run other workflows up to 3 levels deep. Use fewer levels.
error-wff-call-unknown = The workflow to run here isn't in this workspace. Choose another one.
error-wff-change-note-invalid = The note about the change must be one line of 1 to 200 characters. Change the note.
error-wff-check-failed = This version has problems, so it wasn't saved. Fix them and save again.
error-wff-commit-invalid = The saved version to follow isn't a valid 40-character code. Choose it again.
error-wff-condition-invalid = The words that decide this must be 1 to 300 characters. Change them.
error-wff-field-unknown = That file contains something a workflow doesn't support. Remove it and try again.
error-wff-file-malformed = ordin couldn't read that file. Choose a workflow file that was exported from ordin.
error-wff-file-too-large = That file is too large. Keep it under 256 KB.
error-wff-format-newer = That file comes from a newer version of ordin. Update ordin to open it.
error-wff-format-unsupported = That file isn't in a form ordin recognises. Choose a workflow file exported from ordin.
error-wff-group-too-large = Too many steps are set to run at the same time. Run fewer together.
error-wff-if-paths-invalid = A choice needs 2 to 4 differently named paths, and at least one must have a step. Change the paths.
error-wff-input-invalid = A workflow can ask for up to 20 answers, each with its own label of 1 to 60 characters. Check them.
error-wff-input-label-invalid = Each answer needs its own label of 1 to 80 characters. Change the label.
error-wff-limit-above-max = One of the limits is higher than your company allows. Lower it.
error-wff-limit-invalid = The number of repeats allowed after a failure must be from 1 to 5. Change it.
error-wff-limit-lowered = A limit was above what your company allows, so it was lowered.
error-wff-line-invalid = A line must be 1 to 200 characters. Change it.
error-wff-loop-list-invalid = A repeated step must use a list answer or the result of an earlier step. Choose one.
error-wff-loop-max-invalid = A repeated step can go through 1 to 50 items. Change the number.
error-wff-name-duplicate = A workflow with that name already exists here. Choose another name.
error-wff-name-empty = Give the workflow a name of up to 80 characters.
error-wff-name-invalid = The name must be 1 to 80 characters. Change the name.
error-wff-name-too-long = That name is too long. Use 80 characters or fewer.
error-wff-origin-invalid = Where this workflow came from is written too long. Shorten it to 200 characters or fewer.
error-wff-position-invalid = A step's number isn't written correctly or is out of order. Number steps like 1, 2, 2a or 3.1.
error-wff-purpose-invalid = The purpose must be 1 to 2000 characters. Change the purpose.
error-wff-repository-invalid = That agent source isn't known to your organisation or isn't a secure web address. Choose another one.
error-wff-send-without-ask = A step that sends email must ask first. Turn on asking first.
error-wff-too-deep = A workflow can have up to 50 steps, nested up to 4 levels deep. Simplify it.
error-wff-too-many-steps = A workflow can have up to 50 steps and blocks in all. Remove some.
error-wff-use-not-on-path = A step uses a result that isn't available at that point. Use a result from an earlier step on the same path.
error-wff-version-gap = The version numbers don't follow on one by one. Save again to carry on from the latest.
